    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A biomass boiler project commissioned by  Aga Khan University Hospital, Nairobi  (AKUH,N) in September 2023 has won the National Energy Globe Award granted by the Energy Globe Foundation Austria. AKUH,N is part of an international health system belonging to the Aga Khan University.",
